  "scope": "30 sequential fresh processes; three repetitions rotate workload order and reverse implementation order. Four server workers on CPUs0-3, one frozen client on CPUs4-7. Eight-second cases hold8192 idle rooms and one private pair, 1KiB values/window16. Private has no churn/inspection. Churn adds eight reconnect workers. Full adds200 complete HTTP listings/s; cbor adds200 complete authenticated CBOR channel queries/s; page100 requests200 first100-row pages/s and verifies full traversals at quiescent gates. Equivalent outputs within each workload; full body/sender/FIFO/field/order/cursor/Close/EOF/exact counter/resource checks. No builds, profilers or competing load tests overlap ordinary timing.",
